const topics=['有机化学','高分子化学','晶体化学','无机综合与结构推断','方程式与元素化学','热力学与化学平衡','电化学','动力学','分析化学'];
const slugByTopic={'有机化学':'organic','高分子化学':'polymer','晶体化学':'crystal','无机综合与结构推断':'inference','方程式与元素化学':'elements','热力学与化学平衡':'equilibrium','电化学':'electrochemistry','动力学':'kinetics','分析化学':'analysis'};
const topicIcons={"organic": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9Z M7 9v6m3 3 6-3m0-9-6 3\"/></svg>", "polymer": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6v12h3m15-12v12h-3M6 12l3-4 6 8 3-4M2 12h4m12 0h4\"/></svg>", "crystal": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5Z m-9 5v9l9 5 9-5V8M12 13v9\"/></svg>", "inference": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"m6.5 6.5 3.3 3.3m5-1 3.4-1M10.3 14.4l-3.2 4\"/></svg>", "elements": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 3h6M10 3v7l-6 10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1l-6-10V3M7.5 15h9\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\".5\"/></svg>", "equilibrium": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 8h17l-4-4m4 12H3l4 4M20 8l-4 4M3 16l4-4\"/></svg>", "electrochemistry": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4v12m14-12v12M3 10v11h18V10m-12-4 3-3 3 3m-3-3v12M3 7h4m10 0h4\"/></svg>", "kinetics": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3v17h17M7 16c6 0 5-10 13-10m-4-2 4 2-1 4\"/></svg>", "analysis": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 21h16M9 3h6M10 3v7l-3 5 4 4m3-16v6l-3 5M4 17h7m1 2v2m5-14 3 3m-2 2 3-3\"/></svg>"};
const chevron='<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>';
const downloadIcon='<svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2v10m-4-4 4 4 4-4M3 13v4h14v-4"/></svg>';
let notes={};let paperNotes={};let questions=[];let activeTopic='电化学';let selectedPaper=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('paper')||'all';
function closeMenu(){document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.remove('open');document.getElementById('overlay').classList.remove('open');document.getElementById('menu-toggle').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');}
function render(topic){activeTopic=topic;const all=questions.filter(q=>q.topic===topic);const paperIds=[...new Set(all.map(q=>q.paper))];if(selectedPaper!=='all'&&!paperIds.includes(Number(selectedPaper)))selectedPaper='all';const list=all.filter(q=>selectedPaper==='all'||q.paper===Number(selectedPaper));document.title=`${topic} · Chemy 化学竞赛专题题库`;document.getElementById('breadcrumb-topic').textContent=topic;document.getElementById('topic-title').textContent=topic;document.getElementById('topic-symbol').innerHTML=topicIcons[slugByTopic[topic]];document.getElementById('topic-summary').textContent=list.length?`${list.length} 道完整大题 · 第 39 届 · ${selectedPaper==='all'?paperIds.length+' 套模拟试题':'模拟试题 '+selectedPaper}`:'尚未收录题目';document.getElementById('categories').innerHTML=topics.map(t=>`<button class="category" data-topic="${t}" data-empty="${!questions.some(q=>q.topic===t)}" ${t===topic?'aria-current="page"':''}><span class="category-name"><span class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true">${topicIcons[slugByTopic[t]]}</span><span>${t}</span></span><span class="count">${questions.filter(q=>q.topic===t).length}</span></button>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-topic]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{location.hash=slugByTopic[b.dataset.topic];closeMenu();}));document.getElementById('downloads').innerHTML=list.length&&list.every(q=>q.pdfReady)?`<a class="download" href="downloads/${slugByTopic[topic]}-questions.pdf" download>${downloadIcon}题目 PDF</a><a class="download" href="downloads/${slugByTopic[topic]}-answers.pdf" download>${downloadIcon}答案 PDF</a>`:'';document.getElementById('paper-filter').innerHTML=paperIds.length?`<label for="paper-select">试卷</label><select id="paper-select"><option value="all">全部试卷（${paperIds.length} 套）</option>${paperIds.map(p=>`<option value="${p}" ${String(p)===selectedPaper?'selected':''}>模拟试题 ${p}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:'';document.getElementById('paper-select')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{selectedPaper=e.target.value;const url=new URL(location.href);if(selectedPaper==='all')url.searchParams.delete('paper');else url.searchParams.set('paper',selectedPaper);history.replaceState(null,'',url);render(activeTopic);});document.getElementById('questions').innerHTML=list.length?[...new Set(list.map(q=>q.paper))].map(p=>{const n=p===1?notes:paperNotes[p];return n&&(n.instructions||n.scoring)?`<details class="paper-notes"><summary>模拟试题 ${p} · 提示、常数与评分说明</summary><div class="paper-notes-content">${n.instructions?'<h3>原卷提示与常用缩写</h3>'+n.instructions:''}${n.scoring?'<h3>原卷统一评分说明</h3>'+n.scoring:''}</div></details>`:'';}).join('')+(list.length>1?(list.length>8?`<details class="paper-notes"><summary>题目索引（${list.length} 道）</summary>`:'')+`<nav class="question-jump" aria-label="本专题题目">${list.map(q=>`<a href="#${slugByTopic[topic]}" data-question="${q.id}">模拟试题 ${q.paper} · 第 ${q.number} 题${q.title?' · '+q.title:''}</a>`).join('')}</nav>`+(list.length>8?'</details>':''):'')+list.map(q=>`<article class="question" id="${q.id}"><div class="q-meta"><span class="topic-badge">${q.topic}</span><span>原卷第 ${q.number} 题</span><span>${q.points} 分</span></div><h2 class="q-title">第 ${q.number} 题　${q.title}（${q.points} 分${q.percent==null?'':'，占 '+q.percent+'%'}）</h2><div class="q-origin">第 39 届 · 模拟试题 ${q.paper}　题目合集第 ${q.questionPages} 页 · 答案合集第 ${q.answerPages} 页</div><div class="q-body">${q.body}</div><details class="answers"><summary><span>查看参考答案</span>${chevron}</summary><div class="answer-caption">原卷参考答案与评分细则</div><div class="answer-content">${q.answer}</div></details></article>`).join(''):`<section class="empty"><h2>尚未收录该专题题目</h2><p>当前已收录 ${new Set(questions.map(q=>q.paper)).size} 套模拟试题，共 ${questions.length} 道大题。跨专题大题保留完整题干，归入一个主专题。</p><a href="#electrochemistry">阅读电化学题目</a>　<a href="#organic">阅读有机化学题目</a></section>`;document.querySelectorAll('[data-question]').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',e=>{e.preventDefault();document.getElementById(a.dataset.question).scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}));document.querySelectorAll('.answers').forEach(d=>d.addEventListener('toggle',()=>{d.querySelector('summary span').textContent=d.open?'收起参考答案':'查看参考答案';}));window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});}
function fromHash(){return topics.find(t=>slugByTopic[t]===location.hash.slice(1))||'有机化学';}
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>render(fromHash()));
document.getElementById('menu-toggle').addEventListener('click',()=>{const b=document.getElementById('menu-toggle');const open=b.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open',open);document.getElementById('overlay').classList.toggle('open',open);});
document.getElementById('overlay').addEventListener('click',closeMenu);document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')closeMenu();});
Promise.all(['questions.json','paper1-notes.json','papers.json'].map(path=>fetch(path).then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw new Error('题目加载失败');return r.json();}))).then(([data,common,papers])=>{questions=data;notes=common;paperNotes=papers; document.querySelector('.sidebar-bottom').innerHTML=`<strong>第 39 届 · 模拟题</strong><br>当前收录 ${new Set(questions.map(q=>q.paper)).size} 套 · ${questions.length} 道完整大题<br>题目与答案保留原卷出处`;render(fromHash());}).catch(()=>{document.getElementById('questions').innerHTML='<section class="empty"><h2>题目暂时无法加载</h2><p>请刷新页面重试。</p></section>';});
